UID:05fa01ce8fb9e48c@kidcal
DTSTAMP:20261113T182525Z
DTSTART:20261113T213000Z
DTEND:20261113T223000Z
SUMMARY:Kids Comic Club
LOCATION:Kay Fox Room
URL:https://keenenh.libcal.com/event/17443349
CATEGORIES:kids\,Keene Public Library
DESCRIPTION:For comic fans ages 8-12! We'll meet once a month to create to
 gether\, discuss great graphic novels\, and watch interviews and tutorials
  from our favorite artists. All skill levels are welcome\, and materials w
 ill be provided! Meetings will be held on the second Friday of each month.
 \n\nRegistration is appreciated. Questions or Concerns call the library 60
 3.352.0157.\nSource: Keene Public Library
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:46d0503c4f1b8510@kidcal
DTSTAMP:20261113T182525Z
DTSTART:20261114T160000Z
DTEND:20261114T180000Z
SUMMARY:Ladybug Festival
LOCATION:Heberton Hall Kitchen
URL:https://keenenh.libcal.com/event/17091088
CATEGORIES:kids\,Keene Public Library
DESCRIPTION:Don't miss this year's celebration of the Ladybug Books! Your 
 children have been reading them in school and we have several copies avail
 able to check out. Once again\, Keene State College Kappa Delta Pi Educati
 on Honor Society students are planning their best-ever Ladybug Picture Boo
 k Award event. We will be reading aloud and facilitating crafts and games 
 in celebration of the 2026 Ladybug Picture Books. Join us for another fun-
 filled afternoon of reading\, playing\, and crafting. Most importantly\, b
 e sure to vote for your favorite Ladybug Picture Book for 2026! Light refr
 eshments are provided. This event is designed for children ages 3 - 10 and
  their friends and families. Registration is appreciated but please feel f
 ree to drop in.\nSource: Keene Public Library
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:dcaed9120b7c9b43@kidcal
DTSTAMP:20261113T182525Z
DTSTART:20261116T210000Z
DTEND:20261116T220000Z
SUMMARY:Library Build a Rama
LOCATION:Youth Department
URL:https://keenenh.libcal.com/event/17103900
CATEGORIES:kids\,Keene Public Library
DESCRIPTION:Calling all builders! Come build with LEGO® bricks\, we have 
 a huge variety of bricks to encourage your imagination to go wild. Our Bui
 ld-a-Rama club is open to kids of all ages.\nSource: Keene Public Library
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:881732c3f253c0ac@kidcal
DTSTAMP:20261113T182525Z
DTSTART:20261117T230000Z
DTEND:20261118T000000Z
SUMMARY:KPL Online Resources: Ancestry Library Edition and Family Search
LOCATION:Masiello Classroom
URL:https://keenenh.libcal.com/event/17178716
CATEGORIES:kids\,Keene Public Library
DESCRIPTION:Did you know your library card gives you free access to powerf
 ul online learning platforms\, skill-building tools\, and interactive data
 bases? Each month\, join us for a step-by-step demonstration of one of our
  featured digital resources. We’ll guide you through setting up an accou
 nt\, navigating the platform\, and making the most of its features for per
 sonal growth or career development. Bring your device to follow along\, or
  just sit back and watch!\n\nThis Month: Ancestry Library Edition and Fami
 ly Search\nSource: Keene Public Library
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:1158868489650c44@kidcal
DTSTAMP:20261113T182525Z
DTSTART:20261118T153000Z
DTEND:20261118T161500Z
SUMMARY:Preschool Storytime
LOCATION:Storyroom
URL:https://keenenh.libcal.com/event/17090842
CATEGORIES:kids\,Keene Public Library
DESCRIPTION:Preschool storytimes are geared towards pre-kindergarteners ag
 es 3 to 5\, who can sit and listen to short stories and participate in sim
 ple songs and rhymes. Storytime will always include read-aloud stories and
  fingerplays and may include poems\, music\, dramatic play\, and crafts. \
 n\n \n\nThis is a 7-week series\, which ends the week of November 15th. Wh
 en you sign up for one class\, you will automatically be registered for ea
 ch class in the series.\n\nPLEASE NOTE: We will not meet on Wednesday Nove
 mber 11th in honor of Veterans Day. Our last meeting will be Wednesday Nov
 ember 18th.\nSource: Keene Public Library
END:VEVENT
