SUMMARY:Beginning Sewing
LOCATION:Kingsbury Makerspace
URL:https://keenenh.libcal.com/event/17864671
CATEGORIES:kids\,Keene Public Library
DESCRIPTION:Come learn the basics of sewing by making a simple small zippe
 red bag.\n\nTo participate in this workshop please complete the online tut
 orial: Introduction to the Makerspace\n\nThis workshop is intended to intr
 oduce basic sewing skills through making a zippered bag. All materials are
  provided. If you have questions please contact A Welby awelby@keenenh.gov
  or Amy Kraemer at akraemer@keenenh.gov\nSource: Keene Public Library
END:VEVENT
