UID:014cc541a00f3be9@kidcal
DTSTAMP:20261113T182525Z
DTSTART:20261205T180000Z
DTEND:20261205T200000Z
SUMMARY:Holiday Tea - Celebrate the Winter Solstice
LOCATION:Heberton Hall\, Heberton Hall Kitchen
URL:https://keenenh.libcal.com/event/17091130
CATEGORIES:kids\,Keene Public Library
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the Winter Solstice at Keene Public Library’s Annu
 al Tea Party on Saturday\, December 5\, 2026\, from 1–3 pm ! Join us for
  a special presentation by a guest presenter from American Stonehenge to d
 iscover the history\, traditions\, and wonders of the Winter Solstice. Gat
 her with friends\, sip something warm\, enjoy delicious goodies\, and welc
 ome the winter season with an afternoon of warmth\, wonder\, and discovery
 !\n\nRegistration is required. For more information please email Amy akrae
 mer@keenenh.gov or call 603 352-0157\nSource: Keene Public Library
END:VEVENT
