BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:e830b1a60be1e088@kidcal
DTSTAMP:20261113T182525Z
DTSTART:20270511T220000Z
DTEND:20270511T230000Z
SUMMARY:Taking the Time to Pause for Menopause with Lior Sideh
LOCATION:Miller-Vincent Room
URL:https://keenenh.libcal.com/event/17724149
CATEGORIES:kids\,Keene Public Library
DESCRIPTION:Lior Sadeh of Three Fold Herbal Healing presents:Taking the Ti
 me to Pause for Menopause - Tuesday\, May 11\, at 6 pm ET\n\nMenopause is 
 a natural life transition that brings significant changes to the endocrine
  system\, affecting both body and mind. Navigating these changes can be ch
 allenging\, especially when layered with the myths\, stigma\, and societal
  expectations that often surround menopause.\n\nJoin us for an encouraging
 \, informative\, and accessible presentation that demystifies the menopaus
 al transition and offers practical tools to help you feel your best. Regis
 tration is Required.\n\nLior Sadeh\, is a clinical herbalist who weaves mo
 dern\, evidence-based knowledge with traditional Western herbalism. As a "
 retired" farmer with over a decade of experience in herb growing and medic
 ine-making\, she has developed an intimate relationship with many of the h
 erbs she uses in her practice.\n\nLior practices root cause herbalism. One
  phrase that you will often hear her say is\, "It's Not what you take\; it
 's what you Do."\n\nThrough her workshops she hopes you gain a better unde
 rstanding your body's language\, so you can:\n\n\n	Advocate for your healt
 h by asking the right questions when you visit your PCP\n	Make small steps
  toward a lifestyle better suited for your body while being supported ever
 y step of the way.\nSource: Keene Public Library
END:VEVENT
