SUMMARY:Mini Madness – How did we get here?
LOCATION:Main Reading Room
URL:https://brookslibraryvt.org/event/mini-madness-how-did-we-get-here/
CATEGORIES:kids\,Brooks Memorial Library
DESCRIPTION:Where did the Brattleboro Festival of Miniatures come from? An
 d how did our town become mini mad? Well\, like most good ideas\, it start
 ed small and grew! \nHear all about it from founder and miniatures champio
 n\, Melany Kahn. She’ll share her own history with miniatures\, why she 
 wanted to see them in every window in town\, and what everyone can expect 
 this year. She’ll be in conversation with Brooks Memorial Library’s mi
 niatures maven Katherine Larrabee\, who will highlight library resources a
 vailable to the mini-curious\, as well as information about upcoming theme
 d events at the library. Don’t miss this opportunity to learn more about
  the festival and how to make the most of the 2026 Brattleboro Festival of
  Miniatures.\nSource: Brooks Memorial Library
END:VEVENT
