 ttleboro\, VT\, 05301\, United States
URL:https://brookslibraryvt.org/event/haiku-class-festival-of-miniatures/
CATEGORIES:kids\,Brooks Memorial Library
DESCRIPTION:Learn the art of haiku as part of the Brattleboro Festival of 
 Miniatures. Do you love poetry? Come learn the basics of this miniature po
 etic style with a big impact at Brooks Memorial Library. Students will lea
 rn the 5 principles of haiku\, be introduced to some of the most prolific 
 poets of haiku\, and have an opportunity to workshop their in-class poems.
  \nFree and open to the public. Materials will be provided\, and any writi
 ngs created in the class may be submitted to the 2026 Festival of Miniatur
 es Haiku Competition.\nSource: Brooks Memorial Library
END:VEVENT
